From 1f03b15099ee8b459ab3f8badbf6ce9380b5a5ba Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Guild Idler Patch <patch@guild-idler.local>
Date: Wed, 12 Aug 2026 04:26:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add Harvest tab unlock chain and Gathering Bounty quest
 offers

- New one-time intro chain 'the_first_haul' (reqLevel 1, 2 stages) that
  unlocks the Harvest tab via a new ChainDef.grantsHarvest flag, same
  pattern as grantsHatchery/grantsPeddler
- Harvest tab now hidden until harvestUnlocked, matching Hatchery/
  Grimsby's own gating -- but with a deliberate backward-compat
  exception: SaveManager migration 34->35 grandfathers any save with
  real prior Harvest activity straight to unlocked, since (unlike
  Hatchery/Grimsby) Harvest was already unconditionally visible before
  this patch and defaulting old saves to locked would be a regression
- New procedurally-rolled 'Gathering Bounty' quest offer type
  (QuestManager.generateGatheringOffer), only rolled once harvestUnlocked
  is true: sends a hero to fetch a specific material instead of clicking
  the Harvest minigame directly. Rate calibrated at 40 material/hour --
  80% of the ~50/hr a zero-tool-investment hero nets clicking perfectly
  (worked out directly from the real harvest.* tuning values), matching
  the same 'slightly below optimal manual play' shape fastQuestCapsPerHour
  already uses for burst/medium quests elsewhere
- New QuestOffer.materialReward / QuestResult.materialGained fields;
  payout capped by warehouse capacity same as a manual Harvest catch,
  15%-of-full consolation on failure matching gold's own shape
- Fixed another pre-existing DevTool schema gap found along the way:
  quest-chains schema was missing grantsPeddler entirely despite it
  being used in code/data since Grimsby shipped
- guild-idler-status.md updated: documents both features, bumps the
  quest-chain total 28->29, and logs the grantsPeddler schema gap
  alongside the earlier requiresChainId one

Verified at runtime: chain completion correctly flips harvestUnlocked
and queues the spotlight; the migration correctly grandfathers saves
with real prior activity and locks genuinely fresh ones; Gathering
Bounty offers never appear before harvestUnlocked; credited amounts
match the duration-scaled 40/hr formula exactly; payouts clamp at
warehouse capacity rather than overflowing it. Full tsc --noEmit and
vite build both pass clean.
